  "run_config_text": "# Circularly polarised Alfven wave (Toth 2000; Gardiner & Stone 2005).\n# Exact nonlinear solution: rho=1, p=0.1, Bx=1, B_perp = A(sin 2pi x, cos 2pi x)\n# with A=0.1 and v_perp = -B_perp/sqrt(rho). The Alfven speed is 1, so on the\n# unit periodic domain the exact state at t=1 is the initial condition itself.\n# The final-minus-analytic difference is therefore true discretisation error,\n# which makes this the order-verification case the discontinuous benchmarks\n# cannot provide. nx is overridden per rung by the convergence driver.\ntest    = cp_alfven\nnx = 512\nxmin    = 0.0\nxmax    = 1.0\ngamma   = 1.6666666666666667\ncfl     = 0.4\nt_end   = 1.0\nbc      = periodic\nglm_cr  = 0.18\ndevice = cpu\nriemann = hll\noutput_format = binary\noutput_file = C:/Users/tangy/Desktop/floatpoint/experiments/week21/cp_alfven_saturation/runs/cp_alfven-double-cpu-n512/grid.bin\n",
